  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>rose-statistic-reduce · 1×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 256 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-rose-statistic-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-rose-statistic-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const startsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; starts: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const endsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; ends: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const weightsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; weights: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const summaryOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; summary: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const binsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; bins: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const ROWS: u32 = 894u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const GROUP_COUNT: u32 = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const LANES: u32 = 256u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const BIN_COUNT: u32 = 18u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const PI: f32 = 3.141592653589793;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">const PERIOD: f32 = PI;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">fn isFiniteFloat(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">fn guardedAtan2(y: f32, x: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  return select(atan2(y, x), sign(y) * 1.5707963267948966, x == 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">fn getScaledQuotient(value: f32, first: f32, second: f32, power: i32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  if (value == 0.0) { return value; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  let numerator = frexp(value);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  let firstDivisor = frexp(first);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  let secondDivisor = frexp(second);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  let quotient = frexp(numerator.fract / (firstDivisor.fract * secondDivisor.fract));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  return ldexp(quotient.fract,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">    numerator.exp - firstDivisor.exp - secondDivisor.exp + power + quotient.exp);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; tileBin: array&lt;u32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; tileWeight: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedCount: array&lt;u32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedWeight: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedCosine: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedSine: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedDirectionCosine: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedDirectionSine: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"49\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"50\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  _ = &amp;starts;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  _ = &amp;ends;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  _ = &amp;weights;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  _ = &amp;summary;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  _ = &amp;bins;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  let lane = localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">for(var group=workgroupIndex;group&lt;GROUP_COUNT;group+=INVOCATION_COUNT / LANES){\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  let isActiveGroup = group &lt; GROUP_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  let binBase = binsOffset + group * BIN_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  if (isActiveGroup) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">    for (var bin = lane; bin &lt; BIN_COUNT; bin += LANES) { bins[binBase + bin] = 0.0; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  var count = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  var weightTotal = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  var cosine = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  var sine = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  var directionCosine = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  var directionSine = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  for (var tile = 0u; tile &lt; ROWS;) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">    let row = tile + lane;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">    let hasRow = isActiveGroup &amp;&amp; lane &lt; ROWS - tile;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">    var rowBin = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">    var rowWeight = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">    if (hasRow) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">      if (!(false)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">        let start = vec2f(starts[startsOffset + row * 2u], starts[startsOffset + row * 2u + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">        let end = vec2f(ends[endsOffset + row * 2u], ends[endsOffset + row * 2u + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">        let delta = end - start;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">        let lengthSquared = dot(delta, delta);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">        let weight = weights[weightsOffset + row];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">        if (lengthSquared &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; weight &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(lengthSquared) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(weight)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">          // Transform the vector, rather than a rounded atan2 result. Opposite axial vectors\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">          // now reach atan2 with identical bits, including signed-zero cardinal components.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">          var direction = delta;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">          if(direction.y&lt;0.0||(direction.y==0.0&amp;&amp;direction.x&lt;0.0)){direction=-direction;}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">          direction=select(direction,vec2&lt;f32&gt;(0.0),direction==vec2&lt;f32&gt;(0.0));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">          var angle = guardedAtan2(direction.y, direction.x);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">          if (angle &lt; 0.0) { angle += 2.0 * PI; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">          // Curated formula binding: phi is the doubled axial angle, with a 2*pi period.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">          let circularAngle = 2.0 * angle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">          let unitDirection=direction/sqrt(lengthSquared);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">          let cosineAngle = (unitDirection.x-unitDirection.y)*(unitDirection.x+unitDirection.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">          let sineAngle = 2.0*unitDirection.x*unitDirection.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">          cosine += weight * cosineAngle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">          sine += weight * sineAngle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">          directionCosine += cosineAngle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">          directionSine += sineAngle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">          weightTotal += weight;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">          count++;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">          var binPosition = (circularAngle / (2.0 * PI)) * f32(BIN_COUNT);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">          let nearestBoundary=round(binPosition);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">          // Snap only the f32 uncertainty interval around an integer bin boundary (four ULPs).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">          if(abs(binPosition-nearestBoundary)&lt;=4.76837158203125e-7*max(1.0,abs(binPosition))){binPosition=nearestBoundary;}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">          rowBin = u32(floor(binPosition)) % BIN_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">          rowWeight = weight;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">    tileBin[lane] = rowBin;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">    tileWeight[lane] = rowWeight;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">    if (isActiveGroup) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">      for (var bin = lane; bin &lt; BIN_COUNT; bin += LANES) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">        var added = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">        for (var other = 0u; other &lt; LANES; other++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">          if (tileBin[other] == bin) { added += tileWeight[other]; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">        bins[binBase + bin] += added;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">    if(ROWS-tile&lt;=LANES){break;}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">    tile+=LANES;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">  sharedCount[lane] = count;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">  sharedWeight[lane] = weightTotal;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">  sharedCosine[lane] = cosine;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">  sharedSine[lane] = sine;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">  sharedDirectionCosine[lane] = directionCosine;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">  sharedDirectionSine[lane] = directionSine;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">  for (var stride = LANES / 2u; stride &gt; 0u; stride /= 2u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">    if (lane &lt; stride) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">      sharedCount[lane] += sharedCount[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">      sharedWeight[lane] += sharedWeight[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">      sharedCosine[lane] += sharedCosine[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"147\">      sharedSine[lane] += sharedSine[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">      sharedDirectionCosine[lane] += sharedDirectionCosine[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">      sharedDirectionSine[lane] += sharedDirectionSine[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"152\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"153\">  if (lane == 0u &amp;&amp; isActiveGroup) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"154\">    let base = summaryOffset + group * 5u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"155\">    summary[base] = f32(sharedCount[0]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"156\">    if (sharedWeight[0] &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(sharedWeight[0])) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"157\">      let totalWeight = sharedWeight[0];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"158\">      let meanCosine = getScaledQuotient(sharedCosine[0],totalWeight,1.0,0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"159\">      let meanSine = getScaledQuotient(sharedSine[0],totalWeight,1.0,0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"160\">      var meanAngle = guardedAtan2(meanSine, meanCosine);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"161\">      if (meanAngle &lt; 0.0) { meanAngle += 2.0 * PI; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"162\">      meanAngle *= 0.5;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"163\">      let resultant = length(vec2&lt;f32&gt;(meanCosine,meanSine));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"164\">      let outputMean = meanAngle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"165\">      summary[base + 1u] = select(outputMean,0.0,outputMean&gt;=PERIOD);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"166\">      summary[base + 2u] = resultant;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"167\">      summary[base + 3u] = 1.0 - resultant;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"168\">      let validCount = f32(sharedCount[0]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"169\">      let rayleighZ = (sharedDirectionCosine[0] * sharedDirectionCosine[0] +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"170\">        sharedDirectionSine[0] * sharedDirectionSine[0]) / validCount;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"171\">      summary[base + 4u] = rayleighZ;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"172\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"173\">      let nan = bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (group &amp; 0u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"174\">      for (var slot = 1u; slot &lt; 5u; slot++) { summary[base + slot] = nan; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"175\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"176\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"177\">  // Lane zero must finish consuming shared moments before the next group reuses them.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"178\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"179\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"180\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>starts<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"starts\">starts</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>ends<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"ends\">ends</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>weights<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"weights\">weights</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>summary<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"summary\">summary</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>bins<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"bins\">bins</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPURoseStatistic/axial · main · 4855a4e6</figcaption></figure></section>",
